&lt;p&gt;The Squarespace Finance team is seeking a Finance Manager to serve as a dedicated FP&amp;amp;A business partner to our R&amp;amp;D organization. This is a high-impact, high-autonomy role responsible for overseeing the financial health of a large, complex technology portfolio spanning Engineering, Product, and Squarespace&#39;s expanding AI initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Squarespace scales its investment in artificial intelligence, this role will be instrumental in building the financial infrastructure to track AI costs, evaluate ROI, and translate complex technology spend into strategic insights for senior leadership. The ideal candidate brings deep financial expertise, strong cross-functional instincts, and the judgment to operate independently in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the FP&amp;amp;A Director and be based in our New York City office.&lt;/p&gt;
