&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Programs Manager who will own our go-to-market launch process end to end — from identifying upcoming product releases to coordinating launch execution to driving post-launch follow-through. This is a high-ownership role for someone who thrives in the details, moves fast, and knows how to align cross-functional teams around a shared plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the connective tissue across PMM, Product, Growth, and channel teams, ensuring every launch lands with clarity, coordination, and momentum. Beyond launches, you&#39;ll help us build the systems and playbooks that make our GTM process more repeatable and scalable over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role working from our New York office 3 days per week. You will report to the Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
