&lt;li&gt;10+ years in business operations, strategy, or consulting, ideally at a SaaS or technology company; Chief-of-Staff experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a data, analytics, data science, or product organization is strongly preferred. Experience supporting growth or growth marketing organizations in a technology company, with an understanding of how those teams use data, measurement, and experimentation to drive business outcomes, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
