&lt;p&gt;Squarespace is looking for a frontend-focused engineer who enjoys owning features end-to-end. While your expertise is building exceptional user experiences, you&#39;re comfortable working across the stack to deliver secure, scalable identity solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) team, where we architect the mission-critical authentication, authorization, and account security frameworks that safeguard millions of users worldwide. We own the systems powering sign-in, sign-up, account recovery, multi-factor authentication, passkeys, OAuth, and identity verification. Our mission is to make security seamless - creating intuitive user experiences while building highly reliable and secure backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a Frontend Engineer who strives to go beyond what is possible in a web browser, we want to hear from you! You will report to the Engineering Manager in our New York City headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Get To...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
