&lt;p&gt;Squarespace Payments is dedicated to simplifying the financial side of commerce, enabling merchants to securely and reliably collect payments from their customers with minimal effort. Our team&#39;s mission is to build and maintain systems that allow merchants to focus on what matters most: growing their brand!&lt;/p&gt;
