&lt;p&gt;Squarespace is seeking a talented Staff Software Engineer to support and evolve the systems at the core core of our monetization platform: billing, payments and orders. In this role, you will provide technical oversight over the critical monetization machinery that accepts orders, processes payments and bills subscriptions. You will regularly collaborate with engineering leadership and key product, strategy and finance stakeholders to align technical strategy with Squarespace’s business objectives. This is an opportunity to take on IC technical leadership responsibilities and own system architecture for high-visibility initiatives tied directly to Squarespace&#39;s core businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role working from our NYC office 3 days per week. You will report to the Director of Revenue Systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Get To...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own system architectural vision and design for critical areas of our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform high-level system vision into estimated project plans for initiatives central to Squarespace’s strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as technical lead and cross-functional liaison on business-critical projects, making and defending engineering decisions key to the success of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on the team to deliver ever greater quality with ever growing autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best practices for engineering excellence and technical leadership, influence design reviews, question assumptions, point out pitfalls and foster shared understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the engineering quality bar for the team through regular, high-quality code contributions across billing, orders and payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 or more years experience specifying, delivering and maintaining complex distributed backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience with multiple programming languages (especially Java) and a broad range of tools like Springboot, hibernate, databases, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading system architecture decisions across multiple teams or initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to serve as a technical lead on cross-functional projects, aligning engineering and business goals without sacrificing engineering quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with billing, orders or payment systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A choice between medical plans with an option for 100% covered premiums including medical, dental, and vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Life and Disability Insurance plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility and adoption benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headspace mindfulness app subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement benefits with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks paid parental leave and family care leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pretax commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee donation match to community organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 Global Employee Resource Groups (ERGs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dog-friendly workplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private rooftop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hack week twice per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cash Compensation Range: $185,500 - $299,000 USD&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary for this position will vary based on job-related criteria including relevant skills, experience, and location, among other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the cash compensation above (which includes base salary and, where applicable for eligible roles, may include overtime pay), Squarespace employees are eligible to be granted an option to purchase our common stock. Sales positions generally offer a competitive On Target Earnings (OTE) incentive structure in addition to base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Squarespace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarespace is a design-driven platform helping entrepreneurs build brands and businesses online. We empower millions of customers in more than 200 countries and territories with all the tools they need to create an online presence, build an audience, monetize, and scale their business. Our suite of products range from websites, domains, ecommerce, and marketing tools, as well as tools for scheduling with Acuity and creating and managing social media presence with Bio Sites and Unfold. Our team of more than 1,700 is headquartered in New York City, with offices in Dublin, Ireland, and Aveiro, Portugal. For more information about our company, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.squarespace.com/about/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.squarespace.com/about/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, more than a million people around the globe use Squarespace to share different perspectives and experiences with the world. Not only do we embrace and celebrate the diversity of our customers, but we also work toward the same in our employees. At Squarespace, we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ethnicity, ancestry, religion, national origin, gender, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or parental status, disability, veteran status, or other class protected by applicable law. We are proud to be an equal opportunity workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thank you in advance for providing the following details about your work history from your resume! This helps us ensure that your candidate information is accurate and consistent during the hiring process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squarespace will never solicit your personal banking information or ask you to transfer money in connection with a job offer or interview. We also will not reach out to you via phone or SMS without your permission or knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you plan to use AI in any capacity during your candidate journey, please review our &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sqsp.link/Sxow3s&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Systems Technologist to shape how AI is woven into our customer support operation. This is a hands-on, systems-minded role at the center of how Customer Operations functions: integrating external tools and internal platforms, building workflow automation, and enabling self-help. LLM-driven tools, agents, and automations are providing new and powerful opportunities to reshape all of these functions, and you&#39;ll be empowered as a technologist with more tools at your disposal than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we work closely with dedicated core product and engineering teams, we need someone who sits directly within Operations to move fast. You won&#39;t be building our core SaaS product; instead, you&#39;ll own the AI logic, the custom tools, and the integrations that empower our support agents and improve our customer experience, from the chatbot that talks to customers to the internal automations that take work off our agents&#39; plates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about putting LLMs into production, thinking end to end about how systems fit together, and seeing the immediate impact of your work on daily operations, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Get To...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Custom Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain custom Zendesk Apps for agent-facing data visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical configuration of our AI chatbot (Assembled): API scripting, JSON parsing, conversation flow design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer Custom Objects, Liquid Markup, and Dynamic Content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI coding tools to ship production code faster, with sound judgment on when generated code is ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build quality checks and fallback paths so chatbot logic fails safely, not silently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect our support tools to internal systems (Slack, Jira) and third-party vendors, using scripting and low-code platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data flows correctly between our support frontend and backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own what you ship: build maintainable, well-tested solutions, and define how you&#39;ll know it&#39;s working in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Customer Operations needs into technical requirements and API specs for partner engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide when a solution stays in Support Platform scope versus needs a scalable infrastructure project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI / LLM Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building or configuring AI-powered features in production, chatbot logic, LLM API integrations, prompt design, and orchestration (Assembled, Ada, Ultimate.ai, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent with modern AI coding tools, with the judgment to know when generated code is production-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API Fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong grasp of REST APIs, Webhooks, and JSON, including OAuth/API key auth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Ecosystem Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Administering or developing for &lt;strong&gt;Zendesk&lt;/strong&gt; (Zendesk Support, Guide, and App Framework) is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chatbot/AI Logic:&lt;/strong&gt; Configuring chatbot logic and API integrations within chat flows (Assembled, Ada, Ultimate.ai, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low-Code Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable using Zapier, Make, or Workato when custom code isn&#39;t necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Track record of taking ambiguous problems to shipped, reliable solutions with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liquid Markup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing PRDs or technical specs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend knowledge (HTML/CSS) for internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production JavaScript (Node.js) and/or Python, building tools others depend on, not just scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
